<!doctype html><html lang="en-GB"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"/><title>Privacy information | Excel Roofing</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css"/></head><body><main class="simple-page"><a href="/"><img src="/images/logo.svg" width="150" height="108" alt="Excel Roofing home"/></a><p class="eyebrow" style="margin-top:60px">DEMO WEBSITE</p><h1>Privacy information</h1><p>This is a demonstration website for Excel Roofing Ltd. Please use test details when reviewing the enquiry form.</p><h2>Enquiry details</h2><p>The form asks for your name, phone number, postcode, project information and optionally your email. Submitted information is stored through Netlify Forms so the website administrator can review and respond to enquiries.</p><h2>Browsing this demo</h2><p>This demo does not include advertising or analytics scripts. It stores a session preference in your browser so the logo introduction plays only once per tab session. The hosting provider may process technical request information to deliver and secure the website.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>For questions about an enquiry or to request removal of submitted details, call Excel Roofing on <a href="tel:01543433289"><u>01543 433289</u></a>.</p><p>A complete business privacy notice should be confirmed before the production website launches.</p><a class="button button-navy" href="/">Back to the website <span>↗</span></a></main></body></html>
